00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:32.260
Faça.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:33.300
Três movimentos

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:34.240
repetíveis e claros.

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:35.460
Execute relatórios

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:35.880
