00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:36.500
de acesso a dados

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:36.880
para identificar

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:37.680
a site de compartilhamento.

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:38.720
ative o controle

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:39.440
de acesso restrito

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:40.040
para seus cofres

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:40.520
